//RS 
//RS /// Version 1 package-view field matrix.
//RS ///
//RS /// `manifest` is the uncomposed declaration view and `package` is the
//RS /// composed package-facts view. Both expose only manifest metadata that has no
//RS /// `@build.*` spelling; current-package identity stays exclusively at
//RS /// `@build.package.name` and `@build.package.version`. `dependencies` and
//RS /// `outputs` use the underlying `BTreeMap` key order. `packages` and
//RS /// `build_profiles` retain model order. Lock package and root-dependency lists
//RS /// retain lock-model order. Profile sets and collision maps use key order;
//RS /// profile `extends`, `packages`, and `sources` retain declaration order.
//RS /// Optional source fields are `Option<String>` and collections are present as
//RS /// empty lists when the model has no declarations. Dependency source strings
//RS /// redact Git URL credentials and URL parameters; files are read only through
//RS /// the pinned package-root authority. Every operation returns a `Result` whose
//RS /// failure is `PackageReadError { code, file, message, cause }`; the Jet
//RS /// carrier is `CompilerPackageError` with the same four fields. The retained
//RS /// model records no per-field source positions, so the views expose no
//RS /// fabricated position data.
//RS pub use PackageModel::PACKAGE_MODEL_SCHEMA_VERSION;
